{
  "id": "alg8-c3-s3-n20",
  "card_id": "alg8-c3-s3-n20",
  "chapter": "第三章　等差数列和等比数列",
  "section": "§7. 等比数列",
  "number": "20",
  "title": "恒等式$(a-b)(a^2+ab+b^2)=a^3-b^3$和$(a+b)(a^2-ab+b^2)=a^3+b^3$",
  "printed_title": "20. 恒等式$(a-b)(a^2+ab+b^2)=a^3-b^3$和$(a+b)(a^2-ab+b^2)=a^3+b^3$",
  "start_page": 113,
  "start_printed": 106,
  "figures": [
    {
      "id": "fig-32",
      "label": "图 32",
      "page": 117
    }
  ],
  "exercise_count": 14,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们来看含两个变量$a$和$b$的多项式：\n$a^{n-1}+a^{n-2}b+a^{n-3}b^2+\\cdots+ab^{n-2}+b^{n-1}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 106,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0113#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们来看含两个变量$a$和$b$的多项式：$a^{n-1}+a^{n-2}b+a^{n-3}b^2+\\cdots+ab^{n-2}+b^{n-1}$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "容易看出组成这个多项式的项的规律性。\n底数$a$的幂指数从$n-1$减小到0，而底数$b$的幂指数从0增大到$n-1$（第一项可看成积$a^{n-1}b^0$，最后一项可看成积$a^0b^{n-1}$）。\n\n在多项式的每一项中，变量的幂指数的和都等于$n-1$。\n这个多项式的项数等于$n$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 106,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0113#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "容易看出组成这个多项式的项的规律性. 底数$a$的幂指数从$n-1$减小到0，而底数$b$的幂指数从0增大到$n-1$(第一项可看成积$a^{n-1}b^0$，最后一项可看成积$a^0b^{n-1}$)，并且在多项式的每一项中，变量的幂指数的和都等于$n-1$. 这个多项式的项数等于$n$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在$n=2$的特殊情况下，多项式的形式为：\n$a+b$。\n当$n=3$时，它的形式为：\n$a^2+ab+b^2$。\n\n当$n=4$时，它的形式为：\n$a^3+a^2b+ab^2+b^3$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 106,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0113#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "在$n=2$的特殊情况下，多项式取$a+b$的形式，当$n=3$时，它取$a^2+ab+b^2$的形式，当$n=4$时，它取$a^3+a^2b+ab^2+b^3$的形式.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "多项式$a^{n-1}+a^{n-2}b+a^{n-3}b^2+\\cdots+ab^{n-2}+b^{n-1}$可以看成第1项等于$a^{n-1}$、公比等于$\\frac{b}{a}$的等比数列前$n$项的和。\n如果$a\\ne0$，$b\\ne0$，并且$a\\ne b$，那么根据等比数列前$n$项的和的公式，就得：\n$a^{n-1}+a^{n-2}b+a^{n-3}b^2+\\cdots+ab^{n-2}+b^{n-1}$ $=\\frac{b^{n-1}\\cdot\\frac{b}{a}-a^{n-1}}{\\frac{b}{a}-1}=\\frac{\\frac{b^n-a^n}{a}}{\\frac{b-a}{a}}=\\frac{b^n-a^n}{b-a}$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 106,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0113#8",
        "p0114#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "多项式$a^{n-1}+a^{n-2}b+a^{n-3}b^2+\\cdots+ab^{n-2}+b^{n-1}$可以看成第1项等于$a^{n-1}$、公比等于$\\frac{b}{a}$的等比数列前$n$项的和. 如果$a\\ne0$，$b\\ne0$，并且$a\\ne b$，那么根据等比数列前$n$项的和的公式，就得：$a^{n-1}+a^{n-2}b+a^{n-3}b^2+\\cdots+ab^{n-2}+b^{n-1}$ $=\\frac{b^{n-1}\\cdot\\frac{b}{a}-a^{n-1}}{\\frac{b}{a}-1}=\\frac{\\frac{b^n-a^n}{a}}{\\frac{b-a}{a}}=\\frac{b^n-a^n}{b-a}$，",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "也就是：\n$a^{n-1}+a^{n-2}b+a^{n-3}b^2+\\cdots+ab^{n-2}+b^{n-1}=\\frac{a^n-b^n}{a-b}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 107,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0114#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "也就是$a^{n-1}+a^{n-2}b+a^{n-3}b^2+\\cdots+ab^{n-2}+b^{n-1}=\\frac{a^n-b^n}{a-b}$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因此：\n$(a-b)(a^{n-1}+a^{n-2}b+a^{n-3}b^2+\\cdots+ab^{n-2}+b^{n-1})=a^n-b^n$。\n(1)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 107,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0114#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "因此，$(a-b)(a^{n-1}+a^{n-2}b+a^{n-3}b^2+\\cdots+ab^{n-2}+b^{n-1})=a^n-b^n$.　(1)",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "推导公式(1)时，我们假设$a\\ne0$，$b\\ne0$，并且$a\\ne b$。\n但是，容易检验，当$a=b=0$时，这个等式也是真等式。\n因此，在变量$a$和$b$所有取值数对的集合上，公式(1)是恒等式。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 107,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0114#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "推导公式(1)时，我们假设$a\\ne0$，$b\\ne0$，并且$a\\ne b$. 但是，容易检验，当$a=b=0$时，这个等式也是真等式. 因此，在变量$a$和$b$所有取值数对的集合上，公式(1)是恒等式.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "特别是，当$n=2$和$n=3$时，恒等式(1)分别取下列形式：\n$(a-b)(a+b)=a^2-b^2$，(2)\n$(a-b)(a^2+ab+b^2)=a^3-b^3$。\n\n(3)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 107,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0114#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "特别是，当$n=2$和$n=3$时，恒等式(1)分别取下列形式：$(a-b)(a+b)=a^2-b^2$，　(2)$(a-b)(a^2+ab+b^2)=a^3-b^3$.　(3)",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "公式(2)我们很熟悉。\n现在我们将利用公式(3)作某些变形。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 107,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0114#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "公式(2)我们很熟悉. 现在我们将利用公式(3)作某些变形.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例如，假设需要把二项式$8x^3-125y^3$分解因式。\n得到：\n$8x^3-125y^3=(2x)^3-(5y)^3=(2x-5y)(4x^2+10xy+25y^2)$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 107,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0114#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "例如，假设需要把二项式$8x^3-125y^3$分解因式. 得到：$8x^3-125y^3=(2x)^3-(5y)^3=(2x-5y)(4x^2+10xy+25y^2)$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在恒等式(3)中，用$-b$代替变量$b$，得到：\n$[a-(-b)]\\cdot[a^2+a(-b)+(-b)^2]=a^3-(-b)^3$，即：\n$(a+b)(a^2-ab+b^2)=a^3+b^3$。\n\n(4)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 107,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0114#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "在恒等式(3)中，用$-b$代替变量$b$，得到：$[a-(-b)]\\cdot[a^2+a(-b)+(-b)^2]=a^3-(-b)^3$，即　$(a+b)(a^2-ab+b^2)=a^3+b^3$.　(4)",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    }
  ],
  "schema": "ld-s10y-lesson/edition-lesson@1",
